ould do was follow the path I remembered and felt my way across the wall as I ran toward my safe space..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Astor","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Come out, blind girl!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Lena","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We'll cure you! Hahaha..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I curled up in the tiny cabinet. This was a place that only I knew about. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It was roughly in the right corner of the warehouse and very hard to find, owing to all the piled-up stuff blocking it from view."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lena","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Come on out! I'm running low on patience!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Astor","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Forget it, Lena. That blind girl must be wetting herself in a corner somewhere. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Let's wait outside the door... When she comes out, we'll give her a surprise..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Hit","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They laughed loudly as they walked out of the warehouse, but I couldn't tell if they were lying in wait at the doorway or if they had lost interest and left."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Therefore, I could only cower in the cabinet and wait for time to go by..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Rustle—Someone was moving the cardboard. Is it a ragpicker? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I hugged myself tightly by reflex."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I found you some food, but I'm not sure if you can eat it..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"An object giving off an appetizing aroma is held before my face and I eagerly grab it and eat it. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I try to recall when I last ate. It must have been about three days ago when I happened to find a piece of cold bread by the road."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Take it easy. Nobody's taking it from you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mm... Thank you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Chains_Break","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Creak—it's the sound of rusted parts rubbing against each other. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then, I sense him sitting beside me, though he's still keeping a distance from me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't you... want some?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I... I've eaten."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I swallow big mouthfuls of food and the warm sensation fills me with comfort and security, to the point where I almost cry. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Many times, in my heart, I have questioned the parents that I had never met—why have you brought me into such a world? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But this warm food alone helps me briefly put aside my resentment and give thanks that I am alive."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_UnicornTeam","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"flashback","raw":"回忆"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Berle Orphanage, Bremen."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After huddling inside the cabinet for who knows how long, I ended up falling asleep."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_doorknock_wood","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Knock knock— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A gentle knocking woke me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I figured you'd be here."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I reached out into the darkness when a warm hand took mine and held it up against her face, a face that I knew very well—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Rosita..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was about to say something when a small piece of bread was stuffed into my hands— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This was the dinner that the orphanage would give us every day, but she had given it all to me. The warmth of her palms was both kind and reassuring..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I bet you haven't eaten all day, right? You must be starving."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I wolfed down the bread in a few mouthfuls. Rosita then joined me in the cabinet. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I could feel her warmth pressed against my body, putting me at ease."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Say, you should give yourself a name. Calling you by a number just feels weird. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Especially when I'm looking for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I think a number is pretty good."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fine."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The other children had told me that names are given by one's parents, and if nobody gives you a name, then even if you take one for yourself, it's not really your name."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh yes, I've got some good news for you!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What is it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Housemother says I can go into the Sweet Dream Box!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Rosita's breath fills my ear with warmth, but it fills my heart with icy dread."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You mustn't... You mustn't go into the box!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But why? All the kids here want to go. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Housemother once said that when you enter the Sweet Dreams Box, your wishes will come true!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's a scary thing..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why do you say that? It's not like you've gone inside before."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I told you, right? I once overheard what Housemother said... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And I heard the kids inside the Sweet Dreams Box... Their screams were so awful..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There must've been some misunderstanding."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Rosita crawls out of the cabinet and grabs my hand to help me out."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No more talking bad about the Sweet Dreams Box. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You know I've been waiting a long time for this day."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Any more and I'll get mad!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All I could do was keep quiet and followed Rosita back to my room."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Wake","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After finishing all the food he got for me, I lean against the wall in satisfaction."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Where did you come from?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I do not understand."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's alright... I know you're not Pavel... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"He would never have given me food."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Chains_Break","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I reach out in his direction, but everything I touch is hard metal, with no soft parts. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All I can do is try my hardest to imagine what he might look like."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I came from the Siberian Wastes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Where is that?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Far, far away from Warsaw. I had to take the intercontinental train to come to Warsaw."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The intercontinental train..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It is like a huge serpentine beast made of steel with long carriages..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wow, how does it move?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It runs at great speeds over the rails. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's wrong?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My friends and I have been working to repair the rails on the Siberian Plains all these years. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So I find it very hard to describe how I felt when I rode the intercontinental train that went over these rails."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's amazing... You've done something incredible."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Something incredible... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How about you, then? Where did you come from?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I came from the Berle Orphanage in Bremen. I'm trying to get back there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"An orphanage... Why do you want to go back there?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have a friend who's waiting for me there. I need to find her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I feel around in my pocket and find the slip of paper the Rosita had sewn into it, the one with an address on it. I breathe a sigh of relief as I find that it is still there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Can you tell me about her?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_UnicornTeam","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"flashback","raw":"回忆"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Berle Orphanage, Bremen. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The day when Rosita would enter the Sweet Dreams Box was coming soon. With a heavy heart, I arranged to meet her for a chat in the cabinet one last time."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She came at the agreed time. I heard her light footsteps come to a stop in front of the cabinet, and then she opened the door to climb inside."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Huh? Why aren't you in here?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Close","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I pushed her into the cabinet and wedged the door shut with a broom."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Hit","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Rosita","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are you doing?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Hit","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Rosita exploded into a startling wail and the cabinet door rattled frantically as she pounded it with her little fists. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I backed out of the warehouse and her cries faded away as I closed the door. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I was sure Housemother would find her by dinnertime."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry... Rosita..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I felt my way around Rosita's room and climbed into the Sweet Dreams Box that had been placed in there. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By the time I woke up again, I had no idea where I was."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_ChessKingTeam","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A cold voice spoke by my ear."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lab Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Next... Rosita, aged 11..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Heartbeat","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My heartbeat raced with nervous heat every time the cold instruments pressed against my body."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lab Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dr. Rugosa, this girl doesn't match her information. There's something wrong with her eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Doctor","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Never mind, let's not waste time. If her other organs are fine, then send her in."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOn","raw":"白屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Send me in... But where to? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Is he a doctor? Will he cure my eyes? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My mind began to wander nervously as I lay on the cold, hard slab."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"},{"type":"whitescreenOff","raw":"白屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"fullwhite","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tinnitus_0","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My memories of what happened next are a jumbled mess. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I couldn't understand what was done to me. All I could feel was the endless pain... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In my mind, countless gleaming needles grew larger and larger in an endless sea of darkness..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tinnitus_0","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A vortex of pain surrounded me, and my consciousness was peeled away, reawakened, then peeled away again... Like a bleeding wound that was repeatedly opened up, drowning me in an abyss of eternal wails... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I screamed and struggled with all my might... Until all the words I could think of lost their meaning and only Rosita's resentful cries echoed in my ears..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_WilliamRoom","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"flashback","raw":"回忆"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Amb_Rain_0","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_BaseDoor_Close","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"m_avg_labyrinth","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't know how long it was until I was aware of my surroundings again, "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The place around me seemed to have changed, and all I could hear was the roar of machinery, while all I could smell was a horrible rotting stench."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, still alive?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What is this place? Who are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is their garbage dump. I'm Pavel, the supervisor here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The garbage dump..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Experimental rejects like you all get dumped here. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I was missing a helper, and since you were still breathing, I dug you out."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, don't just stand around. Help me move the corpses!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_woodfloor","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Pavel didn't wait for an answer and walked off. All I could do was follow the sound of his footsteps."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_lifttable","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The ground below my feet was uneven, and I tripped over things every now and then. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Soon, Pavel noticed—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You... you're not blind, are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"God dammit. I found a live one at last but it's still trash."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"He angrily picked me up and dumped me into the boot of a car."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Car_Close","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bam— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The rear hatch slams down."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Just as I was about to pass out from lack of air, the boot finally opened and I greedily inhaled the fresh air."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is it, take it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Before I could figure out what was going on, several hands grabbed me and roughly dragged me off the car."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I sensed danger, so I instinctively struggled free and ran upwind."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bangbangbang—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I heard gunshots and Pavel's screams, but I couldn't look back, all I could do was run forward with all my might..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fortunately, I met this Pavel. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"He doesn't want to hurt me; he even gave me food."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_21winter_avg_mahaline","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's a long, long story. I'll tell you after I wake up."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sure."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Perhaps it's because I've exerted myself too much today, but I feel a little giddy and my body is light, as though I'm going to become a balloon at any moment and fly off into the sky."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you alright?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah... I'm just a little tired..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are these marks on your body? You look like you're sick... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, I forgot you can't see..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's alright... I'll just sleep for a bit..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I slowly curl up against Pavel's leg and drift off into dreamland. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As I'm about to fall asleep, I remember that I haven't told Pavel—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SickGirl","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Me","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My name is Rosita. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's not my real name, but I don't have any others."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-TD_Worker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Pavel","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then I will be Pavel. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It doesn't matter what our names are. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You are you, and I am I."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I laugh, and then my dreams enfold me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
